OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder after
OL,4,Adeath of teenager
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man aged 20 has been charged with
OL,7,Fmurder following the death of a
OL,8,Fteenager in Luton.
OL,10,FIt follows an incident in which
OL,11,FBedfordshire Police was called to
OL,12,FDallow Road in the town at about 22:50
OL,13,FBST on Friday to reports of a collision
OL,14,Fbetween a car and an e-bike.
OL,16,FThey found a 19-year-old with serious
OL,17,Finjuries, but despite the actions of
OL,18,Femergency services, he was pronounced
OL,19,Fdead shortly after.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
