OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder after
OL,4,Adeath of teenager
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe arrested man, who is from the town,
OL,7,Fhas been remanded in custody and is
OL,8,Fexpected to appear before Luton
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court on Monday.
